oring alert: Application Down on WorkerNode1HL"], "createdAt": "2026-08-01T09:38:55.884Z", "modelUsed": "Gemini 3.5 Flash", "rootCause": "Process crash or OOM kill, port 8080 conflict with another process, missing app files, bad permissions, or network block.", "viewCount": 1, "helpfulCount": 0, "resolutionSteps": ["DIAGNOSE: Check if NexaCore process is running: ps aux | grep nexacore_app | grep -v grep", "DIAGNOSE: Check if port 8080 is listening: ss -tlnp | grep 8080 || netstat -tlnp 2>/dev/null | grep 8080", "DIAGNOSE: Check last 20 lines of app log: tail -20 /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore.log 2>/dev/null || echo log_not_found", "DIAGNOSE: List app directory files and permissions: ls -lah /opt/nexacore-app/", "DIAGNOSE: Test HTTP response: curl -s -o /dev/null -w HTTP_CODE:%{http_code} http://localhost:8080 2>/dev/null || echo curl_failed", "STOP: Kill any process holding port 8080: fuser -k 8080/tcp 2>/dev/null; sleep 2; echo port_cleared", "STOP: Kill any lingering NexaCore python processes: pkill -f nexacore_app.py 2>/dev/null; sleep 1; echo process_cleared", "RESTORE: Ensure app directory exists with correct permissions: mkdir -p /opt/nexacore-app && chmod 755 /opt/nexacore-app", "RESTORE: If nexacore_app.py is missing write it: [ -f /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore_app.py ] || python3 -c 'import http.server,socketserver,os; open(\\"/opt/nexacore-app/nexacore_app.py\\",\\"w\\").write(\\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\\\nimport http.server, socketserver, os\\\\nPORT = 8080\\\\nos.chdir(\\\\\\"/opt/nexacore-app\\\\\\")\\\\nclass Handler(http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\\\\n    def do_GET(self):\\\\n        self.path = \\\\\\"/index.html\\\\\\"\\\\n        return super().do_GET()\\\\nwith socketserver.TCPServer((\\\\\\"0.0.0.0\\\\\\", PORT), Handler) as httpd:\\\\n    httpd.allow_reuse_address = True\\\\n    httpd.serve_forever()\\\\n\\")' && chmod +x /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore_app.py", "RESTORE: Check if index.html exists - test -f /opt/nexacore-app/index.html && echo index_ok || echo index_missing_escalate_devops", "START: Fix file permissions: chmod 644 /opt/nexacore-app/index.html 2>/dev/null; chmod 755 /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore_app.py && echo perms_ok", "START: Launch NexaCore as background daemon: nohup python3 /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore_app.py > /opt/nexacore-app/nexacore.log 2>&1 &", "START: Wait for server to initialize: sleep 4", "VERIFY: Confirm port 8080 is in LISTEN state: ss -tlnp | grep 8080", "VERIFY: Confirm app returns HTTP 200: curl -s -o /dev/null -w HTTP_STATUS:%{http_code} http://localhost:8080", "VERIFY: Confirm process is in process table: ps aux | grep nexacore_app | grep -v grep"], "configurationItem": "WorkerNode1HL", "sourceIncidentIds": [], "workNotesAnalyzedCount": 1}, {"id": "KB0000002", "title": "Troubleshooting & SOP: Core Router High Latency in NYC Datacenter", "author": "🤖 NVIDIA Nemotron 3 550B Knowledge Agent", "number": "KB0000002", "summary": "Standard Operating Procedure to diagnose and resolve Core Router High Latency in NYC Datacenter service issues.", "category": "Application - Code & SSO Fix", "symptoms": ["Service Core Router High Latency in NYC Datacenter reported degraded state", "Connection timeouts or refused connections in logs."], "createdAt": "2026-08-01T09:38:49.250Z", "modelUsed": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3 550B / Meta Llama 3.3 70B (NIM)", "rootCause": "Improper configuration settings, corrupted state files, or service crash due to memory pressure.", "viewCount": 1, "helpfulCount": 0, "resolutionSteps": ["ssh root@192.168.100.101 \\"Log in to the target system and verify service process status: 'ps aux | grep Core' or systemctl status.\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.101 \\"Inspect logs using journalctl or logs in /var/log/ to identify specific errors.\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.101 \\"Restart the affected service process and verify it binds successfully to its network port.\\"", "ssh root@192.168.100.101 \\"Confirm the service state remains healthy and operational metrics return to baselin